{
  "slug": "memory-compactor",
  "name": "Memory Compactor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Automatically monitors MEMORY.md size and warns Claude to compact it when it exceeds a configurable line threshold. Installs a PostToolUse hook on  Write/Edit to memory directories, preventing auto-memory index overflow (only first 200 lines are loaded).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `memory-compactor` (Use when the user wants to automatically keep MEMORY.md compact).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install memory-compactor@claude-community` from `sharooncs/claude-memory-compactor`.\n\nAutomatically monitors MEMORY.md size and warns Claude to compact it when it exceeds a configurable line threshold.",
